URW base font data (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
----------------------------------------------

The standard-font tables below are derived from the URW base fonts (Nimbus
Sans and Nimbus Roman), as distributed in the MuPDF 1.28.1 source archive
(resources/fonts/urw/). The fonts carry: (URW)++, Copyright 2014 by (URW)++
Design & Development; and the directory's OFL.txt: Copyright 2016 by (URW)++
Design & Development, SIL Open Font License 1.1. The generated data keeps that
licence and those notices; the full licence text and source notices are in
reference/licenses/urw-metrics/ and reference/licenses/urw-outlines/.

- src/builtin_metrics_data.rs: glyph-name and advance tables from
  NimbusSans-Regular.afm and NimbusRoman-Regular.afm.
- src/builtin_outlines/helvetica.bin and times_roman.bin: unhinted outlines
  of the NimbusSans-Regular and NimbusRoman-Regular CFF fonts, packed (the
  README beside them gives the format).
- src/builtin_outlines/helvetica_bold.bin, helvetica_bold_oblique.bin and
  src/substitute_metrics_data.rs: outlines and advances of NimbusSans-Bold
  and NimbusSans-BoldItalic (the Helvetica-Bold and Helvetica-BoldOblique
  substitutes). The raw assets and their SHA-256 hashes are in
  reference/m1-20261012.
- The fonts the view builds at run time from these outlines keep the same
  OFL-1.1 terms. src/view/fonts_unicode.rs lists the Unicode scalar of each
  URW glyph name, from the Adobe Glyph List (below).
- reference/soft-mask-Helvetica-r24.afm is an unchanged copy of
  NimbusSans-Regular.afm, kept as test data under the same terms.

This is attribution, not endorsement or a claim of font equivalence. Exact-name
Arial substitution is a display policy, not a redistribution of Arial fonts.


