Unicode Character Database
--------------------------

Unicode Character Database 16.0 files (UnicodeData.txt, BidiMirroring.txt,
DerivedBidiClass.txt, Scripts.txt, DerivedCoreProperties.txt), Copyright
Unicode, Inc., Unicode License v3 (engine/generate/data/UNICODE-LICENSE.txt
and engine/generate/data/ucd/license.txt). Used by
src/view/text_unicode_data.rs and src/app/forms/scripts_data.rs. Code-page
mapping facts were taken from the Unicode Consortium's published mapping
files, which are not redistributed here. The PDF standard encodings of
ISO 32000-2 Annex D and Apple's 258 standard Macintosh glyph names were typed
from the published specifications.


