CJK fallback font
-----------------

The engine contains no CJK font. The desktop and mobile apps hand it Droid
Sans Fallback (Copyright (c) 2005-2008 The Android Open Source Project,
Apache-2.0) at run time for CJK text whose font the PDF does not embed; the
font and its notice ship with the apps (assets/fonts/ and
docs/third-party/droid-sans-fallback-NOTICE.txt), not in this crate.
